  ('Four Brothers Drive-in', '4957 NY-22', 'Amenia', 'NY', 'New York', 41.85013, -73.55752, 'Four Brothers Drive-In is more than a movie venue — it\'s an entire experience. Open seven nights a week from spring to fall, the venue also boasts a campground, retro trailers for overnight guests, and an on-site eatery serving everything from lobster rolls to margaritas.', 'https://playeatdrink.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
