  ('Shankweiler\'s Drive-In Theatre', 'Orefield, PA', 'Orefield', 'PA', 'Pennsylvania', 40.6450141, -75.5945524, 'Shankweiler\'s Drive-In Theatre is the oldest operating drive-in theater in the country. The business originally opened in 1934 and operates all year round. In addition to movies, there\'s a snack bar on site with options like veggie dogs, popcorn, cheeseburgers, funnel cakes, and ice cream.', 'https://www.shankweilers.com/', 'isobel78@gmail.com'),
  ('Meadow Bridge Drive-In', '17971 WV-20', 'Meadow Bridge,', 'WV', 'West Virginia', 37.84752, -80.8516, 'West Virginia\'s smallest drive-in, the Meadow Bridge Drive-in, was built in 1953 with a capacity for only 180 cars. And yet it still features one of the lowest admission prices around for a double feature. It is open on weekends only from Memorial Day to Labor Day.', 'https://mbdrivein.weebly.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
