  ('Coyote Drive-In', '223 NE 4th St', 'Fort Worth', 'TX', 'Texas', 32.7649719, -97.3355651, '4-screen drive in movie theater in the heart of downtown Fort Worth. Nightly showings of the newest movies. Huge covered pavilion, outdoor seating, playground, games, full concession stand and sports bar.', 'https://coyotedrive-in.com/', 'isobel78@gmail.com'),
  ('Tascosa Drive In', '1999 Dumas Dr', 'Amarillo', 'TX', 'Texas', 35.23278, -101.8319, 'Amarillo’s Oldest (& Only) Drive-in Movie Theater. Escape to the outdoor big screen at Tascosa Drive In! Encompassed by nature, it’s the perfect setting for when you need a night out with friends and family, or are having a romantic evening with a special someone. This unique cinematic experience blends the nostalgic feeling of classic charm into the modern era effortlessly. Here, you can relive cherished memories or create new ones while enjoying blockbuster hits and timeless classics under the Amarillo sunset.', 'https://amarillodrivein.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
  ('The Delevan Twin Drive-In', '11771 NY-16', 'Delevan', 'NY', 'New York', 42.50851, -78.48007, 'Family-owned seasonal drive-in with two screens and the capacity for 550 cars.', 'https://www.facebook.com/DelevanDrive', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
