  ('Echo Drive In', '240 US-40', 'Roosevelt', 'UT', 'Utah', 40.29158, -109.99615, 'Single screen drive-in movie theater built in 1956. Open April - Labor Day on weekends, it offers a family-friendly experience with popular concessions like tacos. Operated by the independent Roosevelt Theater company which also owns indoor theaters in the area.', 'https://rooseveltmovies.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
  ('Dependable Drive-In Theater', 'Moon Twp, PA', 'Moon Twp', 'PA', 'Pennsylvania', 40.5113549, -80.2545439, 'Built on a former strip mine (it was previously Dependable Coal Co), the only remaining drive-in in Allegheny County has grown from a single screen to a four-screen operation. Film fans appreciate the state-of-the-art high-definition digital projection, Dolby Surround FM Radio Sound, old-timey in-car speakers, and a concession menu that runs deep with chicken tenders, burgers, pizza, funnel cakes, ice cream, and foot-long hot dogs.', 'https://www.dependabledrivein.com/', 'isobel78@gmail.com'),
