  ('Mesa Drive-In Movie Theater', '2625 Santa Fe Dr', 'Pueblo', 'CO', 'Colorado', 38.24314, -104.56442, 'Opened in 1951, this outdoor venue with a concession stand screens current blockbuster movies.', 'http://www.mesadrive-in.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
  ('Holiday Twin Drive In Theatre', '2206 S Overland Trail', 'Fort Collins', 'CO', 'Colorado', 40.55728, -105.13064, 'Double features are always on the menu on both screens at Holiday Twin Drive-In in Fort Collins, Colorado, originally opened in 1968. The snack bar offers adult drinks like beer and margaritas along with hot dogs, cheeseburgers, and meatless Beyond burgers. The drive-in is usually open throughout the summer.', 'https://holidaytwin.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
  ('Galaxy Drive-In Movie Theatre', 'Ennis, TX', 'Ennis', 'TX', 'Texas', 32.38012, -96.6508094, 'With nine screens sprawling along I-45 about 45 miles south of Dallas, the Galaxy still has those old-fashioned metal speaker boxes to hang on your car window for the full nostalgic effect. Open 365 nights a year, this drive-in has two snack bars turning out cotton candy, pizza, nachos, and popcorn at prices that won\'t keep families away.', 'https://www.galaxydriveintheatre.com/', 'isobel78@gmail.com'),
  ('Verne Drive In Theater', '1607 S Kniss Ave', 'Luverne', 'MN', 'Minnesota', 43.63284, -96.21224, 'Retro-style drive-in theater, with shows starting at dusk & a shop with pretzels, ice cream & pizza.', 'https://vernedriveintheater.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
