  ('Tru Vu Drive In Café & Movie Theater', '1001 CO-92', 'Delta', 'CO', 'Colorado', 38.75176, -108.05784, 'Rediscover the magic of cinema under the Colorado Milky Way.', 'https://truvudrivein.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
  ('Chief Drive In Theatre', 'South, US-81', 'Ninnekah', 'OK', 'Oklahoma', 34.9958, -97.93737, 'One of Oklahoma’s last-standing drive-in theaters, the Chief Drive-In is proud to carry on a long tradition of great movies and family fun—under the stars! Open every Friday and Saturday year-round.', 'https://chiefdriveintheatre.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
  ('Roadium Drive-In', '2500 W Redondo Beach Blvd', 'Torrance', 'CA', 'California', 33.88328, -118.32076, 'Flea market and drive-in movie theater featuring an assortment of goods, clothing and food stalls.', 'https://roadium.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
  ('Twin City Drive-In Theatre', '2512 Volunteer Pkwy', 'Bristol', 'TN', 'Tennessee', 36.53074, -82.2487, 'Family operated theatre open on weekends during the spring and fall seasons and nightly during the summer with double features. It doubles as a temporary campground for the NASCAR and Drag races of the Bristol Motor Speedway.', 'https://www.twincitydriveintheatre.com/', 'rh72dgTkWiR6dTeHw9byv2rzqPC2'),
  ('Palace Gardens Drive-In', '225 Indian Springs Rd', 'Indiana', 'PA', 'Pennsylvania', 40.5952784, -79.1537622, 'A double feature of current movies is shown each Friday, Saturday, and Sunday from Memorial Day weekend through Labor Day weekend. Palace Gardens opened in June of 1950 and still uses much of the original equipment, including the dual carbon arc movie projectors.', 'https://palacegardensdrivein.com/', 'isobel78@gmail.com'),
